# Chandra, Torch of Defiance +1: "Exile the top card of your library. You may cast that card. If you don't, Chandra deals
# 2 damage to each opponent." Four turns, four ways of not casting: turn 1 the card is a land (it cannot be cast);
# turn 3 it is a Disenchant with nothing to target (it cannot be cast, so Bot1 is not even asked); turn 5 it is a
# Disenchant with Mox Ruby to target (it could be cast, Bot1 is asked and declines); turn 7 the library is empty and
# nothing is exiled. Each time Bot2 takes 2 (20 -> 12); every exiled card stays in exile.

